          "description": "The Gargoyles’ first function for the Tremere was that of guardian and watchdog. This power allows them to know instinctively where anyone is inside a given structure. It even allows the Gargoyle to detect characters concealed by magical means, if the Slave is perceptive enough. System: The player spends a Willpower point to activate this power, which remains in effect as long as the Gargoyle is within or in contact with the target struc ture, or until the next sunset. Scry the Hearthstone ma...",
