      "xp_type": "supplemental",
      "content": "*Auspex 5, Presence 3.* **XP 24.** After Presence is used on the user, spend 1 WP to shrug it off and be **immune to that vampire's Presence for the scene**. Only vs Presence 1–5 (elder Presence unaffected); can't be used against lower Generation.",
      "source": "STV Compilation [Supplemental]",
      "is_v20": false
